    "title": "Preserve Scope context on missing Event-view reads",
    "user": {
      "login": "donnabox",
      "id": 520275,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDI3NQ==",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520275?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/donnabox",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/donnabox/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "Authorized reads of an unknown Bead or Link Event view observed the current Scope but returned a 404 without its context headers. Preserve the immutable context captured in the same store entry and project it onto finite JSON and initial SSE GET/HEAD responses. Authentication and malformed-input refusals remain pre-observation; missing identities retain the same nondisclosing Problem body.\n\nValidation:\n- Typecheck, clean build, formatting, lint, boundaries and unchanged Read evidence checks passed.\n- Nine focused source cases passed. The original selection omitted four quoted parameterized titles and failed its count gate; a separate exact selection ran those four cases and the pending SSE callback once.\n- An emitted omission control produced the eight expected context failures. Its original tooling postcheck failed; separate inspection verified generated shim/symlink path normalization with unchanged effective dependencies and product bytes. The original failure remains recorded.\n- Native Codex and actual Claude reviews completed; all ten Claude findings have source-grounded dispositions. Fresh archives and an external offline consumer passed: 313 archive members, eight production packages, and one installed-server case with 11 actual HTTP responses. All eight missing Event reads carry the observed context; anonymous 401 remains contextless. Child exited normally and its store was removed. Exact-head full CI remains pending.\n\nNo schema, discovery, public profile admission, release or Preview2 change. The progress document retains its explicitly historical draft checkpoint; current validation is recorded here and in the [sole implementation plan](https://github.com/donnabox/beads/blob/codex/vickie-bdp-client-design/docs/architecture/bdp-client-v2/design.md).\n",
